Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.86,0:22:26.87,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}描いていた出鱈目な落書き
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.87,0:22:32.25,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}その瞳に映る全部を守りたい
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.25,0:22:37.88,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}きみが世界の何処に居ようとも
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.88,0:22:42.80,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}変わらないもの　ぼくらのただいまの場所
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.80,0:22:48.35,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}いつか夢の続きを聞かせてよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.35,0:22:54.23,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}信じているの　きみが描いた未来を
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.23,0:22:58.36,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}駆け抜けた日々なんて　追いつけないほど
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.36,0:23:03.86,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\1a&HFE&\3a&HFF&\4c&H3B4279&\4a&H32&\bord3\shad3\blur2}まだこの先でいろんな景色を　知るだろうけど
